## JSON文件的介绍

**JSON**（**J**ava**S**cript **O**bject **N**otation）是一种流行的格式，允许有更灵活的模式。它对人类来说也很容易阅读和书写。很多在网络上发送的数据都是以JSON形式传输的。下面是一个例子。

```JSON
{
    "glossary": {
        "title": "example glossary",
        "GlossDiv": {
            "title": "S",
            "GlossList": {
                "GlossEntry": {
                    "ID": "SGML",
                    "SortAs": "SGML",
                    "GlossTerm": "Standard Generalized Markup Language",
                    "Acronym": "SGML",
                    "Abbrev": "ISO 8879:1986",
                    "GlossDef": {
                        "para": "A meta-markup language, used to create markup languages such as DocBook.",
                        "GlossSeeAlso": ["GML", "XML"]
                    },
                    "GlossSee": "markup"
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

## 用Python读取JSON文件

Python可以使用内置的`json`库轻松地将这些数据从字符串中读入字典。

content.content:
import json

## Define the JSON object as a string
json_string = """{
    "glossary": {
        "title": "example glossary",
        "GlossDiv": {
            "title": "S",
            "GlossList": {
                "GlossEntry": {
                    "ID": "SGML",
                    "SortAs": "SGML",
                    "GlossTerm": "Standard Generalized Markup Language",
                    "Acronym": "SGML",
                    "Abbrev": "ISO 8879:1986",
                    "GlossDef": {
                        "para": "A meta-markup language, used to create markup languages such as DocBook.",
                        "GlossSeeAlso": ["GML", "XML"]
                    },
                    "GlossSee": "markup"
                }
            }
        }
    }
}"""


# 读取文件
json_data = json.loads(json_string)

print(json_data)
